      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for the temperature ranges, that's really helpful. I'll make sure the team double-checks those specific numbers. \n\nYou mentioned local bakeries and how these principles apply across different products—were you about to say something specific about how they manage their environment or their results? I'm particularly curious if there are any \"hidden\" or less obvious factors that cause these kinds of issues even when the temperature seems okay.",
